# 基本文章編集から文字をウインドウの外へ運んで離す (design 11.3), for tools/ui_run.py. A copy of
# 基本文章編集 with 30 paragraphs (mkbig doc 30) is opened at 100,100 (600 by 400), the letters of
# the second line of its second paragraph picked by carrying the hand across them, and carried
# by the hand out of the window onto the document TADjsについて, which the desktop opened at the
# start (a window of the text editor's process too): the process hands them to the desktop as
# the hand leaves its window (DT_RQ_CARRY with DT_F_TEXT), which drops them there, and takes them
# out of its text. Saved, record 0 of the copy is the one the desktop's own text editor, since
# removed, saved having carried the same letters out; the shots (doc_drop_p_*) are of the copy's
# window (101,125 to 682,482). The keys went with the letters: a press on the copy's name band
# gives them back before it is saved.
# Keys: Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# The desktop's own editor this was once compared with is gone: what it saved and showed
# (record 0, its pictures) is what is wanted of the process here (want, shotsum).
mkbig doc 30
logmark
pdoc big
expectsincein 60 document: opened 基本文章編集 paragraphs 30
wait 800
logmark
drag 160 230 420 230
expectsince document: drew
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_drop_p_picked
logmark
hold 300 230
wait 100
move 400 240
wait 100
move 600 300
wait 100
move 800 420
expectsince document: left the window carrying
wait 1000
move 900 450
wait 1000
up
expectsince document: letters carried out (0)
wait 300
logmark
click 400 112
wait 300
move 690 490
wait 300
shot doc_drop_p_done
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince document: saved (0)
sum show
want ok 5479 c7892d7d2e817f31
logmark
key 08 01
expectsince document: closed
wait 500
